Bundled GlycoMotif annotations
==============================

The internal motif annotations in R/sysdata.rda are derived from the
GlycoMotif resource:

  https://glycomotif.glyomics.org/glycomotif/GlycoMotif

The snapshot incorporated into this package on 2026-07-07 contains the
GlyGen Motifs, CCRC Motifs, GlyTouCan Motifs, GlycoEpitope Epitopes,
Glydin, Glydin - BiOligo, Glydin - Cermav, Glydin - Cummings,
Glydin - Hayes, Glydin - SugarBind, UniCarbKB Motifs, and All Motifs
collections.

GlyGen applies the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0) license to its database sets:

  https://www.glygen.org/license/

Attribution: GlyGen and the GlycoMotif resource. Collection-specific
provenance and original-resource links are available from the GlycoMotif
collection pages.
